      },
      "title": "Expense Logger with Code Checks",
      "author": {
        "id": "u_81dac53ff9c9",
        "displayName": "Blake Torres"
      },
      "createdAt": "2026-10-25T16:00:00Z",
      "body": "Receipts come in by email. The model extracts amount, date and category, then code checks that the amount is a number and the date is in this month. Failed checks retry up to three times before the receipt is flagged.\n\nI caught a $75 grocery receipt the model had dated last year.",
      "sourceUrl": null,
      "source": {
        "provider": "synthetic-fixture",
        "sourcePostId": "syn-w2-p04",
        "communityId": "6acd2896-76e7-400f-9a00-cfd657470859",
        "sourceUrlVerified": false
      },
      "comments": [
        {
          "commentId": "syn-w2-p04-c1",
          "parentId": "syn-w2-p04",
          "author": {
            "id": "u_ca895b4e5559",
            "displayName": "Avery Quinn"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-10-25T16:20:00Z",
          "body": "Checking the date in code instead of asking the model is a good split."
        },
        {
          "commentId": "syn-w2-p04-c2",
          "parentId": "syn-w2-p04",
          "author": {
            "id": "u_4336bff27e7d",
            "displayName": "Drew Patel"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-10-25T16:50:00Z",
          "body": "What happens after the third failed retry?"
        },
        {
          "commentId": "syn-w2-p04-c3",
          "parentId": "syn-w2-p04",
          "author": {
            "id": "u_82686b643d8b",
            "displayName": "Jordan Ellis"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-10-25T17:15:00Z",
          "body": "Nice catch on the date."
        },
        {
          "commentId": "syn-w2-p04-c4",
          "parentId": "syn-w2-p04",
          "author": {
            "id": "u_81dac53ff9c9",
            "displayName": "Blake Torres"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-10-25T17:30:00Z",
          "body": "It lands in a review sheet with the reason, and I fix it by hand."
        }
      ],
